	"__comment__": [
		"COMPOSITE INDEXES REQUIRED BY THE v2 SERVICES.",
		"",
		"DO NOT DEPLOY THIS FILE AS-IS. It contains ONLY v2 indexes. The v1",
		"indexes were created by hand in the console and have never been in",
		"version control, so deploying this alone would mark every one of them",
		"for deletion and break the currently-running v1 app.",
		"",
		"Before deploying:",
		"  1. firebase firestore:indexes --project anthill-51de0 > firestore.indexes.prod.json",
		"  2. merge that file's indexes into this one",
		"  3. save the result as firestore.indexes.json",
		"  4. add \"indexes\" to the firestore block in firebase.json",
		"",
		"Deploy indexes BEFORE the v2 app ships: index builds are near-instant on",
		"collections that already hold data at this scale, but a query issued",
		"against a missing index fails with failed-precondition."
	],
